00:13:09.360 --> 00:13:10.740
but then I read in the manual

00:13:10.740 --> 00:13:12.600
that they're like, you might want to use

00:13:12.600 --> 00:13:13.740
your turbo controller,

00:13:13.980 --> 00:13:15.300
and now I think

00:13:15.300 --> 00:13:16.340
that this game

00:13:16.340 --> 00:13:18.740
was designed around the use of one,

00:13:19.660 --> 00:13:21.920
because, like, otherwise,

00:13:22.180 --> 00:13:23.040
like, I did just die

00:13:23.040 --> 00:13:26.100
immediately because my fingers were getting numb

00:13:26.100 --> 00:13:27.060
from the amount of

00:13:27.060 --> 00:13:28.860
