00:13:28.860 --> 00:13:30.720
tapping the A button

00:13:30.720 --> 00:13:32.140
to, or the B button,

00:13:32.200 --> 00:13:33.480
I don't remember what button I was pressing,

00:13:33.640 --> 00:13:35.940
to shoot. But so, like,

00:13:36.020 --> 00:13:37.240
you do need that,

00:13:37.240 --> 00:13:38.280
or you will have

00:13:38.280 --> 00:13:39.880
some trouble, more trouble

00:13:39.880 --> 00:13:41.000
than you normally would.

00:13:41.180 --> 00:13:42.300
Yeah, and it's totally

00:13:42.300 --> 00:13:43.200
a valid strategy,

00:13:43.200 --> 00:13:44.360
by the way, if you do want

00:13:44.360 --> 00:13:46.480
to beat this game, to just grind it out

00:13:46.480 --> 00:13:47.520
in the very first part

00:13:47.520 --> 00:13:49.100
of the neighborhood. The things that

00:13:49.100 --> 00:13:50.140
the enemies drop

