don't become any

00:13:51.260 --> 00:13:52.780
different later on,

00:13:52.920 --> 00:13:55.300
so theoretically, you could walk out

00:13:55.300 --> 00:13:56.480
before you ever go

00:13:56.480 --> 00:13:57.440
into another building,

00:13:57.460 --> 00:13:58.440
you could have

00:13:58.440 --> 00:14:00.420
the most powerful gun,

00:14:00.700 --> 00:14:02.980
you could have 30 light bulbs

00:14:02.980 --> 00:14:03.940
and all that,

00:14:04.060 --> 00:14:05.480
like, everything's gonna, you know,

00:14:05.620 --> 00:14:07.660
everything could be available to you

00:14:07.660 --> 00:14:08.760
right from the beginning of the game,

00:14:08.920 --> 00:14:10.280
now you just have to figure out

00:14:10.280 --> 00:14:11.480
where to go

00:14:11.480 --> 00:14:12.440
and what to do.

00:14:12.940 --> 00:14:14.200
I feel like

00:14:14.200 --> 00:14:15.900
it's kind of obvious

00:14:15.900 --> 00:14:16.940
based on the path

00:14:16.940 --> 00:14:18.260
