that could make it

00:15:01.060 --> 00:15:02.480
feel more open.

00:15:02.660 --> 00:15:03.680
So I get that.

00:15:03.900 --> 00:15:05.300
It wasn't obvious to me.

00:15:06.240 --> 00:15:07.100
Huh. Okay.

00:15:07.400 --> 00:15:09.020
I guess I didn't feel

00:15:09.020 --> 00:15:09.960
like, I'm not saying like, oh,

00:15:10.100 --> 00:15:11.920
