00:15:56.920 --> 00:15:57.920
It's not like something

00:15:57.920 --> 00:15:58.840
unlocks later.

00:15:59.620 --> 00:16:01.460
I mean, I guess also just

00:16:01.460 --> 00:16:03.200
in terms of level design,

00:16:03.200 --> 00:16:06.100
if it was just a regular,

00:16:07.820 --> 00:16:10.100
