it would be a little,

00:16:16.240 --> 00:16:17.440
a little boring,

00:16:17.740 --> 00:16:18.560
maybe. Well, yeah,

00:16:18.660 --> 00:16:19.680
I mean, I think that the,

00:16:19.860 --> 00:16:21.260
the layout is, this is all about the,

00:16:21.560 --> 00:16:22.460
you know, the game design

00:16:22.460 --> 00:16:23.620
and, you know,

00:16:23.680 --> 00:16:25.060
the reason why cities

00:16:25.060 --> 00:16:26.320
