00:16:31.660 --> 00:16:32.760
But, but,

00:16:33.160 --> 00:16:34.240
yeah, I mean, I, I see,

00:16:34.880 --> 00:16:35.820
I get what you're saying.

00:16:35.940 --> 00:16:38.180
Like, it's not like what we're, it's not like an RPG

00:16:38.180 --> 00:16:39.140
kind of thing

00:16:39.140 --> 00:16:40.520
